release: 2026.7.26
resolution: Work completed and released in 2026.7.26. Release attribution set explicitly so pm-changelog --respect-item-release files the entry under 2026.7.26 instead of the current release notes.
expected_result: "A closed item whose changelog entry appears under the 2026.7.26 heading it actually shipped in, leaving the current release notes untouched."
actual_result: "Before this closeout the item had remained in_progress with no activity since its work shipped, so the delivery was missing from the changelog while still being counted as open work in every fleet audit. Closing it with an explicit release attribution is what added the historical entry."
comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-13T05:00:44.230Z",codex-root,"2026-07-13 GitHub security hardening: public unbraind/pm-web secret scanning and push protection enabled and verified by API; zero open alerts. Non-provider patterns and validity checks remain disabled because GitHub did not enable them for this repository/account despite accepting the PATCH; base protection is active. Existing stale codex-5-3-sweep claim was respected (no force/release). No repository files or telemetry changed."
notes[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-06-09T22:56:18.153Z",codex-5-3-sweep,Added step-specific prompt UX for ready/waiting/blocked plan steps and validated via typecheck/build/test.
  "2026-07-26T12:50:36.365Z",codex,"2026-07-26 measured baseline while finishing child pm-web-wyum: Node test coverage for dist/services/pm-runner.js is 69.45% lines / 73.56% branches / 62.50% functions. The package has no enforced repo-wide 100/100/100/100 coverage gate yet. This remains an explicit production-pass gap; no exclusions or artificial assertions were added to disguise it."
files[4]{path,scope,note}:
  public/src/app.ts,project,expose plan prompt copy handlers
  public/src/views/plan-execution.ts,project,plan readiness and prompt builders
  public/src/views/plan.ts,project,add execution focus dependency guidance
  test/plan-execution.test.ts,project,unit coverage for plan execution snapshot
tests[4]:
  - command: "npm run release:check"
    scope: project
    timeout_seconds: 3600
  - command: PM_PATH=.agents/pm PM_GLOBAL_PATH=.agents/pm npm run typecheck && PM_PATH=.agents/pm PM_GLOBAL_PATH=.agents/pm npm run build && PM_PATH=.agents/pm PM_GLOBAL_PATH=.agents/pm npm test
    scope: project
    timeout_seconds: 3600
  - command: PM_PATH=.agents/pm PM_GLOBAL_PATH=.agents/pm npm test
    scope: project
    timeout_seconds: 3600
  - command: "set -e; ROOT=$(git rev-parse --show-toplevel 2>/dev/null || echo \"$PWD\"); TMP=$(mktemp -d); trap 'rm -rf \"$TMP\"' EXIT INT TERM; cd \"$TMP\"; pm init >/dev/null; pm install \"$ROOT\" --project >/dev/null; pm web doctor --json"
    scope: project
    timeout_seconds: 1200
    note: "Portable doctor smoke test: captures repo root,uses mktemp -d with trap cleanup,installs the current checkout,and never rm -rf a shared fixed path."
close_reason: "Retired as shipped: the full pm ecosystem production pass for pm-web was completed and released in 2026.7.26, but the item was never closed and sat in progress ever since, inflating every fleet audit."
